</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O I am my Beloved’s,</l><l>And my Beloved’s mine;</l><l>He brings a poor vile sinner</l><l>Into His house of wine!</l><l>I stand upon His merit;</l><l>I know no other stand.</l><l>I’m hidden in His presence</l><l>And held by His own hand.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Bride eyes not her garment,</l><l>But her dear Bridegroom’s face;</l><l>I will not gaze at glory,</l><l>But on my King of grace:</l><l>Not at the crown He giveth,</l><l>But on His pierced hand;</l><l>The Lamb is all the glory,</l><l>And my eternal stand!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
